            "review_title": "Review at Design Cafe",
            "review_text": "Rick_Yvanovich\nChur, Switzerland454 contributions\n0\nSurprise corner\nDec 2012 • Family\nThis place is tucked away in a bit of a corner, little street visibility. Its actually a cafe connected to Nha Xinh furniture shop, hence the name Design Cafe.\nIts quiet, there's no smoking, there are a wide range of seats / chairs so you're bound to find one thats comfy for you. Simply a coffee shop with pretty good coffee.\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 25, 2012",
